# Analyze specific time range
response = client.models.generate_content(
    model='gemini-2.5-flash',
    contents=[
        'Summarize this segment',
        types.Part.from_video_metadata(
            file_uri=myfile.uri,
            start_offset='40s',
            end_offset='80s'
        )
    ]
)
```

### Custom Frame Rate

