# Banner Sizes & Art Direction Styles Reference

## Complete Banner Sizes

### Social Media
| Platform | Type | Size (px) | Aspect Ratio |
|----------|------|-----------|--------------|
| Facebook | Cover (desktop) | 820 × 312 | ~2.6:1 |
| Facebook | Cover (mobile) | 640 × 360 | ~16:9 |
