---
name: ck:fix
description: "ALWAYS activate this skill before fixing ANY bug, error, test failure, CI/CD issue, type error, lint, log error, UI issue, code problem."
argument-hint: "[issue] --auto|--review|--quick|--parallel"
metadata:
  author: claudekit
  version: "2.0.0"
