### Keyboard Hints

Auto-fade after first interaction or after 4 seconds.

```css
.deck-hints {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: clamp(12px, 2vh, 24px);
  left: 50%;
  transform: translateX(-50%);
  font-family: var(--font-mono);
  font-size: 11px;
