| Topic | File |
|-------|------|
| SDK API | `references/stitch-sdk-api.md` |
| MCP Setup | `references/stitch-mcp-setup.md` |
| Pipeline Patterns | `references/design-to-code-pipeline.md` |
| Quota Strategy | `references/quota-management.md` |
