## Custom Variants

Create custom state variants:

```css
@custom-variant theme-midnight (&:where([data-theme="midnight"] *));
@custom-variant aria-checked (&[aria-checked="true"]);
@custom-variant required (&:required);
```

**Usage:**
```html
