[book] Marker/PyMuPDF parser (heuristic routing) [note] frontmatter parse  [web_saved] POST /save-web
    │ (exp backoff: [1s, 5s, 30s] on failure)        │                            │
    ▼                                                 ▼                            ▼
SHA-256 content-hash                         content-hash compute      trafilatura extract
    │                                                 │                            │
    ▼                                                 │                            ▼
data/books/<sha256>/                         (Chunker input)         data/web-saved/<sha256>/
