### 3.3. Query (with-web)

То же, что 3.2, плюс перед параллельным retrieval:

```
... soft routing ...
   │
   ▼
multi-signal web evaluation:
  top_k_local_score < 0.4  ?
  parents_total_tokens < 500 ?
  entities_unknown > 0     ?
  intent==explore && parents<3 ?
   │
   yes (any) ▼
sanitization gate:
  - LLM produces web_safe_query
  - strict mode: blocks if [[…]] / #… / sensitive_entities остались
   │
   ▼
SearXNG search → trafilatura → (Playwright fallback) → snippet fallback
   │
   ▼
WebResult[] passed to LLM context with [external, fetched: …] markers
   │
   ▼
... rerank + aggregate + ... (как 3.2)
```

### 3.4. KGE retraining

```
Indexer / Enricher writes → GraphDelta entry in SQLite (app.db → kge_graph_delta)
                                │
                                ▼
                  cron nightly (0 3 * * *) — or event (>100 notes)
                                │
                                ▼
                    compute change_score
                                │
                  ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
                  ▼             ▼             ▼
              < 50          50-500        500-2000 / >2000
              skip          warm-start    full / + HPO
                                │
                                ▼
                  GPU-aware scheduling
                  (defer 1h if RAG hot or GPU>70%)
                                │
                                ▼
                    train new model.pt
                                │
                                ▼
                  quality gate: new_MRR ≥ old × 0.95?
                                │
                  ┌─────────────┴─────────────┐
                  yes                         no
                  ▼                           ▼
              swap (current → new)        keep_old, log
              invalidate predictions
              re-rank pending
                                │
                                ▼
                  generate predictions.parquet
                  → multi-step surfacing pipeline (ADR-0009 §5)
                  → /review queue
```

